{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>微軟出現系統故障，影響電郵等服務，至少十多萬用戶報告受影響。本港不少商業機構都受影響，電郵Outlook帳戶凌晨起一直未能開啟。</p><p></p><p>港交所亦通報，由於微軟的全球系統出現故障，港交所電郵服務目前受到影響，至於所有市場就正常運作。港交所指會監察情況，適時提供最新消息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:35:43.641384+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T03:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T04:29:06.308695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:29:06.308695+00:00","content_hash":"2f0fc61e3b1322f97e19cf305f6139b0a8bb185000e854162dbbeed37eb15bc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}